      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Give Ora Ora"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Oooooohhhh!!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Is, is this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "the one?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "This is..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Ora Ora!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "I'll make it short! Give it to me, and I will give you my treasure! So how's my idea? Wanna deal?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Muhahahahah!!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "I finally have this!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Ora Ora!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Stupid and Disgusting"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Thief Bugs!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "You will pay!!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Huk...Huk..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Sorry, I was out of control with pleasure for a while. Now, I will give my treasure as promised."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "When you wear this over your mouth and start to breathe, it filters junk out before getting to your lungs."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Kakakakakaka!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "I can't wait"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "to use this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Ora Ora!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Huhuhuhuhu..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "What if I can't get rid of all these Thief Bugs? I might even grow to love them... *Huk*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Wahhhhhh! I, I..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "I can't take it any more!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "You little stinky filthy bastards!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Continue"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Oh man..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "It all started when my parents passed away when I was a little kid. Early on I had to work for a living, and had a really hard time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "I've worked for 10 years in hopes of buying my dream house where I could find some sense of peace and comfort again. Eventually I thought I had enough zeny to afford my very own sweet home."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Unfortunately I didn't have enough money to buy the nice house that I had my eye on. But then, I found this house, which was bigger and cheaper than the first. I bought it without thinking..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "Sweet Jesus! Turns out, it's a Heaven for Thief Bugs!!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "I tried to do everything I could do. I coaxed them, killed them, but it only brought peace for a moment! I even tried to burn this house down...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "*Gasp* I mean, really, do I need ^3355FF Ora Ora^000000 to get rid of them? People say it is very rarely seen in distant countries."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "If I could afford 5 of them, I won't have to be frustrated with these disgusting bugs any more..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "[Young Man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "text" : "This never ending fight with the bugs has really exhausted me. I give up. Do as you wish you scumbags!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "[Young man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "...What is it?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Can you make me a special item?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Hey."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "[Young man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Huh? So you already know what I specialize in, eh? I suppose there's no need for the usual secrecy. Tell me what you want."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Helm of Angel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Deviruchi Cap."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "I will come next time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "[Young man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "1 Helm (with slot)."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "1 Angel Wing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "5 Fang of Garm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "That's all I require."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "[Young man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Wait! Just so you know, I don't care if the items in your inventory have been upgraded, or have cards attached."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "[Young man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "I mean, any cards or upgrades in the items I will use to make something for you will be lost once I make the item. So be careful when you hand stuff over to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "[Young man]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Did you gather the items? Then hand them over."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Give him the items."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Young man",
      "text" : "Don't give him the items."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
